We present the Unified Astrophysical Simulation \& Cryptographic Provenance Engine (UAS-CPE),
a multi-physics, invariant-preserving, cryptographically attested simulation core for
relativistic astrophysical systems. The engine maintains strict conservation of Hamiltonian,
magnetohydrodynamic, thermodynamic, and relativistic invariants, with all timesteps
cryptographically proven via zero-knowledge proofs and post-quantum secure channels.
